                                                "sense_id": "92eb1ca0-093a-3827-b94b-5a3a4e24e66d",
                                                "text": "let the sauce down with a little pasta water if it starts to become too thick; if the soup is too thick, you can let it down with a little milk; let the sauce down with a dash of the pickling liquor; use some of the stock to let down the onion sauce"
